# GitHub issue #450 — found while documenting AI auto-approval env vars:
# Dockerfile's `COPY . .` had no .dockerignore to exclude .env, so a real
# local secret (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, ADMIN_JWT_SECRET, etc.) present at
# build time would get baked into the image layer. Mirrors .gitignore.
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.env
.env.local
*.log
scripts/.seed-runs/
